        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12917.txt",
        "text_sha256": "fca5550b007133cf220d40b5942f5d7ef4bab7ae3fe783d248f376a97393c1bd",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1994-05-24/pdf/FR-1994-05-24.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. The following are prohibited, except to the extent provided in \nregulations, orders, directives, or licenses which may hereafter be issued \npursuant to this order, and notwithstanding the existence of any rights \nor obligations conferred or imposed by any international agreement or any \ncontract entered into or any license or permit granted before the effective \ndate of this order:"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2239,
      "char_start": 1821,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12917#sec1-a",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(a)",
      "pdf_page": 203,
      "scope_id": "EO:12917#sec1-a",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "59 FR 26925, PDF pages 203-204",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "3aba34fb492cb13f2fb8353d3815cfff5976483738553b196d54122f3d96c573",
        "signing_date": "1994-05-21",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12917.txt",
        "text_sha256": "fca5550b007133cf220d40b5942f5d7ef4bab7ae3fe783d248f376a97393c1bd",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1994-05-24/pdf/FR-1994-05-24.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(a) The importation into the United States of any goods (other than informa­\ntional materials, including books and other publications, needed for the \nfree flow  of information) originating in Haiti, or of any services perform ed \nin Haiti, that are exported from  Haiti after M ay 21, 1994; or any activity \nby United States persons or in the United States that promotes or is intended \nto promote such im portation.;"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2560,
      "char_start": 2240,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12917#sec1-b",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(b )",
      "pdf_page": 203,
      "scope_id": "EO:12917#sec1-b",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "59 FR 26925, PDF pages 203-204",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "3aba34fb492cb13f2fb8353d3815cfff5976483738553b196d54122f3d96c573",
        "signing_date": "1994-05-21",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12917.txt",
        "text_sha256": "fca5550b007133cf220d40b5942f5d7ef4bab7ae3fe783d248f376a97393c1bd",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1994-05-24/pdf/FR-1994-05-24.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(b ) Any activity by United States persons or in the United States that \npromotes the exportation or transshipment of any goods (other than informa­\ntional materials, such as books and other publications, needed for the free \nflow of information! originating in Haiti that are exported from  H aiti after \nM ay 21, 1994;"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2875,
      "char_start": 2561,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12917#sec1-c",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(c)",
      "pdf_page": 203,
      "scope_id": "EO:12917#sec1-c",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "59 FR 26925, PDF pages 203-204",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "3aba34fb492cb13f2fb8353d3815cfff5976483738553b196d54122f3d96c573",
        "signing_date": "1994-05-21",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12917.txt",
        "text_sha256": "fca5550b007133cf220d40b5942f5d7ef4bab7ae3fe783d248f376a97393c1bd",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1994-05-24/pdf/FR-1994-05-24.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(c) Any dealing by United States persons or in the United States, or \nusing U.S.-registered vessels or aircraft, in any goods (other than informa­\ntional materials, such as books and other publications, needed for the free \nflow of information) originating in Haiti that are exported from Haiti after \nMay 21,1994;"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 3296,
      "char_start": 2876,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12917#sec1-d",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(d)",
      "pdf_page": 203,
      "scope_id": "EO:12917#sec1-d",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
